 :description=>
  "【Summer campaign】Recommended for those planning to move in during July or August!July and August are the absolute peak seasons for tourism and international arrivals in Japan. By booking now, you can still secure your ideal neighborhood and room layout before they are gone!Stay cool and worry-free during the humid Japanese summer with Hmlet’s fixed utility rates—no more stressing over rising air conditioning bills.Reserve your favorite room today with our special summer offer!Special Offer:Get a discount on your initial costs based on your contract length!・Contracts under 6 months: ¥20,000 OFF・Contracts 6 months or more: ¥40,000 OFF＜Eligibility Requirements＞Application Deadline: By June 30, 2026Eligible Move-in Period: Move-in: Anytime in July or August 2026Eligible Properties: All Hmlet properties＜How to Apply＞When applying, please mention that you saw the campaign.Important Notes:- Please note that this offer will not apply unless you mention \"saw the campaign\" at the time of your inquiry.- This campaign is not applicable to current residents seeking lease extensions, transferring to a different room within the same property, or transferring to another Hmlet property.- If a contract or application is cancelled, this campaign will not be valid for any subsequent re-applications.- This offer is valid for individual contracts only; corporate contracts are not eligible.- This campaign cannot be combined with any other promotional offers or discounts.Hmlet Yutenji I is well connected to the city’s main areas. Located just a 6-minute walk from Yutenji Station on the Tokyu Toyoko Line, it offers direct access to Shibuya Station in 6 minutes and Yokohama Station in 26 minutes. Through-service via the Fukutoshin Line also provides direct connections to Shinjuku and Ikebukuro without transferring. It is an ideal location that brings flexibility and ease to both your business and private life.The area surrounding the station features a rich living environment where classic and new charms blend. Starting with \"Etomo Yutenji\" directly connected to the station, the route to the property is lined with the \"Yutenji Shopping Street\" and \"Showa-dori Shopping Street,\" ensuring you never have to worry about daily groceries. Long-established shops coexist with modern cafes and vintage clothing stores, allowing you to feel the unique culture of the neighborhood with every step.Just a 4-minute walk away lies \"Yutenji Temple,\" a Nationally Registered Tangible Cultural Property, where you can experience history and tranquility right in the city. A short stroll further takes you to healing spots rich in nature, such as \"Setagaya Park\" and the \"Jakuzure River Green Way.\" Additionally, all 10 units are equipped with \"NURO\" high-speed internet, supporting a comfortable and productive work-life balance.Why not start a comfortable and enriching new daily life at Hmlet Yutenji I, set in the Meguro-Yutenji area where historic atmosphere and sophisticated culture harmonize?",
