  "【Area】Hiroo area, Minato-kuClosest Station: Hiroo 3 min. walk【Facilities & Service】・Utility charges and internet are included in the rent.・Complementary cleaning service is provided once a month.*Please note that if the total amount of utilities used during your stay exceeds JPY20,000yen per month, you may be charged for the excess amount.*We will specify the cleaning date. Please contact us as soon as possible if you have any requests to change the schedule after we have notified you of the cleaning date.【Regarding Security Deposits】〇Stay Duration: 1–2 months　⇒ 0.5 months’ rent〇Stay Duration: 3–5 months⇒ 1 month’s rent〇Stay Duration: 6–11 months⇒ 2 months’ rent〇Stay Duration: 12 months or longer⇒ 2 months’ rent or more*Cleaning fees vary depending on length of stay------------------------------------------------------------------------------A “modern × elegant” space reflecting the sophistication and international charm of Hiroo.Luxurious oak French herringbone floors and brick walls create a refined, timeless atmosphere.The minimal layout is fully equipped with a kitchen, vanity, and walk-in closet, while an iconic inner-sash partition balances privacy and openness in the bed area.Beyond the balcony’s custom iron fence, the greenery of Arisugawa-no-miya Memorial Park unfolds quietly, offering a serene retreat in the heart of the city.Surrounded by embassies, boutique cafés, and restaurants, the neighborhood exudes subtle color and understated luxury.Where natural tranquility meets urban convenience, the distinctive rhythm of life in Hiroo gently unfolds.",
